Significance: minor
Type: changed

Paint the chart grid and the axis tick labels from CSS, so an `--a8c-charts-color-grid` or `-label-axis` override set on a chart's own element applies to it and follows a theme change with no re-render. The matching `theme` fields — `gridStyles.stroke` and `svgLabelSmall.fill` — still work and are now redundant; prefer the CSS roles.
